  "date": "2026-04-22",
  "draft": false,
  "html": "<p>维护一个 Markdown vault，几个 CLI 工具能省大量时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"h-0\">常用组合</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 找出没有入链的孤儿文章</span>\nrg -l <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;\\[\\[&#x27;</span> vault/posts | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sort</span> | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">uniq</span> -c\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 统计各标签使用频率</span>\nrg -o <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;tags:.*&#x27;</span> vault/posts | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">tr</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;,&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;\\n&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sort</span> | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">uniq</span> -c | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sort</span> -rn\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 按修改时间列出最近写的</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">ls</span> -lt vault/posts/*.md | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">head</span>\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ripgrep</strong>：找链接、找标签、找失效引用</li>\n<li><strong>fd</strong>：比 find 语法友好</li>\n<li><strong>jq</strong>：检查构建产物，如 <code>jq '.nodes | length' public/data/graph.json</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h-1\">哲学</h2>\n<p>这些检查和 <a class=\"wikilink\" data-target=\"markdown-解析管线\" href=\"/mansheng/p/markdown-%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%AE%A1%E7%BA%BF\">markdown-解析管线</a> 做的事情部分重叠，但 CLI 的价值是「写作时随手可用」——不用等构建。复杂的分析还是交给 <a class=\"wikilink\" data-target=\"增量构建实践\" href=\"/mansheng/p/%E5%A2%9E%E9%87%8F%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5\">增量构建实践</a> 里的脚本，CLI 只解决 80% 的即时问题。</p>\n",
